        {
          "en": "Image points are marked with a prime: A′.",
          "bm": "Titik imej ditanda dengan prima: A′."
        },
        {
          "en": "Congruence means same shape and size.",
          "bm": "Kekongruenan bermaksud bentuk dan saiz sama."
